APRIL2022MINUTES
The monthly meeting of the Laramie County Weed &Pest Board of Directors was
held on April 7, 2022, at the Archer Weed &Pest Office in Cheyenne, WY. The meeting
was called to order by Vice Chairman-Guy Landers at 6:30 p.m.
Members present were Vice Chairman-Guy Landers, Treasurer-Dennis Hanson,
Member-Tom Muhlbach, and Member-Darrel Repshire.Also present was Supervisor-Bret
Nelson, Office Manager-Cecelia Smock, and City of Cheyenne Weed & Pest Director-
Steven Trowbridge. Absent were Chairman-Bert Macy, Secretary-Bill Bonham, and
Member-Ryan Farthing.
A motion was made and seconded to approve the March 3,2022, monthly board
meeting minutes.Motion carried.
A motion was made and seconded to approve the March 31, 2022, Treasurer's
Report. Motion carried.
A motion was made and seconded to approve the March 2022 Voucher-Deposit
Report. Motion carried.
A motion was made and seconded to approve the Special Management Landowner
Petitions for another five(5)year term for
Motion carried.
A motion was made and seconded to approve the State Highway spraying bid
contract extension with
[Motion carried.
